@startuml sprint-5-class-knowledge-platform
title Sprint 5 domain class diagram — Operations, testing and deployment

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 180

package "Runtime health (NFR-01)" {
  class HealthProbe <<service>> {
    +getStatus() : HealthResponse
    ..
    Checks PostgreSQL + Redis
  }

  class HealthResponse <<dto>> {
    +status : string
    +postgres : boolean
    +redis : boolean
  }
}

package "Quality gates (NFR-05, NFR-06)" {
  class IntegrationTestSuite <<component>> {
    +suiteCount : 10
    +testCount : 74
    +run() : TestReport
    ..
    Vitest + Supertest
  }

  class TestReport <<artifact>> {
    +passed : int
    +failed : int
    +durationMs : int
  }

  class RagEvaluationHarness <<component>> {
    +runQuick() : RagEvalReport
    +runFull() : RagEvalReport
    ..
    LLM-as-judge metrics
  }

  class RagEvalReport <<artifact>> {
    +faithfulness : float
    +relevance : float
    +jsonPath : string
  }
}

package "Deployment (NFR-04)" {
  class DockerComposeStack <<component>> {
    +services : string[]
    ..
    postgres, redis, api, web
  }

  class PrismaMigrator <<component>> {
    +applyMigrations()
    +seed()
  }
}

package "Infrastructure" {
  class PostgreSQL <<external>> {
    +pgvector extension
  }

  class Redis <<external>> {
    +BullMQ broker
  }

  class NodeApiProcess <<component>> {
    +httpServer
    +ingestWorker
  }
}

package "Design artefacts" {
  class PlantUmlCatalog <<artifact>> {
    +structural : 3
    +sprintUseCase : 5
    +sprintClass : 5
    +sequence : 41
  }
}

HealthProbe --> PostgreSQL : ping
HealthProbe --> Redis : ping
HealthProbe ..> HealthResponse : returns

IntegrationTestSuite --> NodeApiProcess : HTTP contract tests
IntegrationTestSuite ..> PostgreSQL : test schema
IntegrationTestSuite ..> Redis : queue tests
IntegrationTestSuite ..> TestReport

RagEvaluationHarness ..> RagEvalReport
RagEvaluationHarness ..> NodeApiProcess : Ask pipeline

DockerComposeStack *-- PostgreSQL
DockerComposeStack *-- Redis
DockerComposeStack *-- NodeApiProcess
PrismaMigrator --> PostgreSQL

note bottom of IntegrationTestSuite
  **Sprint 5 scope**
  Cross-cutting validation of all prior
  sprint domains; no new Prisma entities.
end note

@enduml
